	<section_number>55.1-2903</section_number>
	<catch_line>Other legal remedies may be used</catch_line>
	<text>
		The provisions of this chapter shall not preempt or limit the owner's use of any additional remedy otherwise allowed by law.
	</text>
	<history>2000, c. 655, § 55-419.1; 2019, c. 712.</history>
